{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18114","headline":"杂诗四首 三 · 韩愈","name":"杂诗四首 三","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"截橑爲欂栌，斵楹以爲椽。\n束蒿以代之，小大不相权。\n虽无风雨灾，得不覆且颠。\n解辔弃骐麟，蹇驴鞭使前。\n崑仑高万里，岁尽道苦邅。\n停车卧轮下，绝意於神僊。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韩愈","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18114.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18114","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}